    {
      "title": "Meta tokens reduce attention map entropy.\nWe visualize the entropy of the attention map for both\nthe attention and SSM heads [20, 16] before and after\nintroducing meta tokens. As introduced in Sec. 2.3 of\nour main paper, the attention map entropy reflects the\ndistribution of attention scores across tokens, where\nlower entropy indicates stronger retrieval effects [7],\nas the attention scores are concentrated around a\nsmaller subset of tokens.",
